     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Hello,<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">It has been a long time, but I have updated to v0.70.0<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">I added 2 new atlases based on the new(ish) &quot;AAL2&quot; parcellation (see ET Rolls et al., NeuroImage, 2015).<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">You can see more changes on the <a href=\"https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/81541239ee738b036800ca72c896da402494a330?short_path=8312ad0#diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/cwatson/brainGraph/commit/81541239ee738b036800ca72c896da402494a330?short_path%3D8312ad0%23diff-8312ad0561ef661716b48d09478362f3&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792488199674000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3g-Ks4TR-g9jZgcgVQy-12\">Github page</a>, and go back a few commits to see more.<br><br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">I have not yet updated the User Guide to reflect this, and probably will not for about 2 weeks.<br></div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif\">Chris<br></div></div>\r\n"
